    rdfs:comment "Building-pipeline build step finished for one crate (#2774). Emitted by chorus-build CLI after all binaries in the crate are signed and recorded in the manifest. Per-binary detail lives in build.artifact.hashed; this event is the crate-level signal the act workflow sequences on. duration_ms enables Loki histogram for build-cache rot detection." ;
    chorus:payloadField "builder_host: Hostname of machine that built it" ;
    chorus:payloadField "commit: Source commit SHA (short) at build time" ;
    chorus:payloadField "crate: Cargo crate name (chorus-hooks, chorus-inject)" ;
