    rdfs:comment "Werk `merge` verb (#3926) — GitHub reported a merge conflict, but `git merge-tree` proved the trees merge CLEAN, so the mergeable flag was stale (async cached field, goes stale when the base branch moves). werk-merge retries once instead of refusing a good branch. Verb-substep event (#3513 naming law)." ;
