    rdfs:comment "The nightly run's wall-clock elapsed measured against Jeff's bar (default 900s, NIGHTLY_ELAPSED_BAR_SECS). Emitted every run so drift above the bar is visible on the spine, not discovered in the morning. #4022 AC3." ;
