    rdfs:comment "Werk `test` verb (#3917) — a changed shell script that NO bats suite references. Named out loud so an unexercised script is a visible gap rather than dissolving into an empty selection (the blind spot #3917 fixed). Verb-substep event (#3513 naming law)." ;
    chorus:payloadField "card: Card the run belongs to" ;
    chorus:payloadField "role: Acting role" ;
    chorus:payloadField "script: Repo-relative path of the uncovered script" ;
