    rdfs:comment "Werk `test` verb (#4419) — the domain lane of the selection: the domains of the registered tests that exercise each changed file (#4419 reopened: from the tests' own covers, not the file's text) and how many registered tests, any layer, those domains select. A changed file in a unit that no test exercises is refused. Verb-substep event (#3513 naming law)." ;
