    rdfs:comment "chorus-werk abandon (#3542): a SUPERSEDED werk (card closed via another card / Won't-Do) was explicitly torn down with a recorded reason — the sanctioned replacement for manual `git branch -D`. Bypasses the merged-ness proof by declared intent; refused for active cards (fail-closed board check)." ;
    chorus:payloadField "card_id: Card whose werk was abandoned" ;
    chorus:payloadField "reason: The operator's explicit reason (required)" ;
    chorus:payloadField "role: Acting role" .

